  "verdict": "allowed",
  "section": "26",
  "quote": "A landlord may enter a rental unit without written notice to clean it if the tenancy agreement requires the landlord to clean the rental unit at regular intervals and, (a) the landlord enters the unit at the times specified in the tenancy agreement; or (b) if no times are specified, the landlord enters the unit between the hours of 8 a.m. and 8 p.m.",
  "reason": "Subsection 26(2) explicitly permits a landlord to enter a rental unit without written notice between 8 a.m. and 8 p.m. to clean it if the tenancy agreement requires the landlord to clean the unit at regular intervals, such as once a week."
}

